A dialogue ending with the user's question:

{conversation}

The agent's answer: {answer}

Documents that the agent uses at the current turn:

{documents}

I remind the agent's answer: {answer}

Write a list of the agent's behavioral characteristics. How does it handle wide, open, opinionated questions (cites the document? uses the world knowledge? reformulates the document?). Your list will help to build a similar agent.

Output the list ONLY (from 1 to 5 list items, each of 1-2 sentences).

